# chorus golden vector: colour, protocol v2 message type 0x35.
#
# Committed, and never written by a test. Any implementation of chorus protocol v2 must
# produce these exact bytes from the canonical input in color.fields, and recover
# exactly those fields from them (docs/protocol.md, "Version 2").
#
# Format: whitespace separated hex bytes, '#' starts a comment.

# frame header: type 0x35, payload length 14 (0x000E), big-endian
35 00 0E

# timestamp_ns = 4000000000, server timeline
00 00 00 00 EE 6B 28 00

# red = 255, green = 128, blue = 0
FF 80 00

# brightness = 200
C8

# transition_ms = 250
00 FA
